## 🧠 Integration

1. **Include header**
   ```c
   #include "qmd.h"
    2. Initialize once at startup
       qmd_config_t qcfg = {0};
       qmd_init(&qcfg); // use defaults or set your own parameters
    3. Call every FOC tick (e.g., 1–2 kHz)
       qmd_tick(dt_s, &sensor_data, &foc_state);
    4. Register CAN transmit callback (optional)
       qmd_register_can_send(platform_can_tx);
    5. Forward incoming CAN commands
       qmd_handle_can_rx(msg_id, data, len);
    6. Access QMD results
       float phase_corr = qmd_get_phase_offset();
       foc_state.theta_cmd += phase_corr;

